# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Copied verbatim from `public/` into `out/` by the
# static export, and applied only to requests that match no static asset.

# The REST API reference spells its endpoints as bare paths (`GET /api/v1/records`).
# Search engines pick those strings up as URLs on this host and crawl them, which
# used to 404 (reported under "Not found (404)" in Search Console). Send the whole
# endpoint family to the page that documents it. Default locale: /zh visitors reach
# the same content through the in-page locale switcher.
/api/v1/*  /en/integrations/rest-api  301
